1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:03,582
(Penny:)I was wondering if you could
maybe teach me a little physics.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:07,543
(Penny:)-A little physics?
-Yeah.

3
00:00:07,711 --> 00:00:10,711
(Sheldon:)There's no such thing.
Physics encompasses the entire universe.

4
00:00:10,881 --> 00:00:13,261
(Sheldon:)From quantum particles to supernovas.

5
00:00:13,467 --> 00:00:16,557
(Sheldon:)From spinning electrons
to spinning galaxies.

6
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,850
(Penny:)Okay, cool,
I don't need the PBS special.

7
00:00:19,598 --> 00:00:22,438
I wanna know enough
so I can talk to Leonard about his job.

8
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:23,771
(Penny:)Like Bernadette does.

9
00:00:23,977 --> 00:00:26,897
(Sheldon:)-Why can't Leonard teach you?
-Because I wanna surprise him.

10
00:00:27,064 --> 00:00:29,024
(Sheldon:)Can't you surprise him
in some other way?

11
00:00:29,191 --> 00:00:33,231
(Sheldon:)For example, I'm sure he'd be delightfully
taken aback if you clean your apartment.

12
00:00:34,237 --> 00:00:36,367
(Howard:)Come on, Sheldon,
this is important to me.

13
00:00:36,531 --> 00:00:38,531
(Sheldon:)This would be
a massive undertaking...

14
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,240
(Sheldon:)...and my time
is both limited and valuable.

15
00:00:41,411 --> 00:00:43,751
(Penny:)You're sitting here
playing video games all day.

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,370
(Sheldon:)Okay, point.

17
00:00:48,001 --> 00:00:49,711
(Sheldon:)What sort of foundation do you have?

18
00:00:49,878 --> 00:00:52,128
(Sheldon:)Did you take any science classes
in school?

19
00:00:52,297 --> 00:00:57,027
(Penny:)Sure. I did the one with the frogs.

